  ('q-v2-cur-reset-accountability-01', 'quiz-v2-cur-reset-accountability', 'Which statement is the approved summary for "How We Work Here: Professionalism + Accountability"?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Schedule training as development, not disguised labor, and transfer ownership in safe stages.","Build five-foot awareness, team hospitality, urgency, and clean handoffs without confusion or scorekeeping.","Know the room, table numbers, traffic paths, tools, hazards, and exact language for a clean handoff.","Make readiness, communication, coachability, checklists, resets, and follow-through observable."]'::jsonb, 'Make readiness, communication, coachability, checklists, resets, and follow-through observable.', 'This is the exact approved summary for How We Work Here: Professionalism + Accountability.', 2, 'cur-reset-accountability'),
