  ('q-v2-cur-reset-accountability-09', 'quiz-v2-cur-reset-accountability', 'Which item is explicitly included under "Observable operating standards"?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Repair the whole table experience. Own the missed item, protect food safety, involve the MOD, and care for the rest of the table while the correction moves. Example: Acknowledge the error, remove or manage the item appropriately, set a realistic update, and follow up with everyone affected.","Reset - give one change for the next rep","Completion is verified and released","Arrive on time, in uniform, with coffee, food, and personal tasks handled."]'::jsonb, 'Arrive on time, in uniform, with coffee, food, and personal tasks handled.', 'This item appears verbatim under Observable operating standards.', 10, 'cur-reset-accountability'),
