  ('q-v2-cur-leadership-week-2-02', 'quiz-v2-cur-leadership-week-2', 'Which outcome is explicitly listed for "Week 2 - Standards Without Ego"?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Ask one useful preference question","Explain the trainer mission and role boundaries","Avoid the Ancho quantity typo","Anyone may protect the standard. The first response to correction is Heard, followed by action."]'::jsonb, 'Anyone may protect the standard. The first response to correction is Heard, followed by action.', 'The module lists this as an explicit learning outcome: Anyone may protect the standard. The first response to correction is Heard, followed by action.', 3, 'cur-leadership-week-2'),
