  ('q-v2-cur-leadership-week-2-05', 'quiz-v2-cur-leadership-week-2', 'Which criterion is explicitly included in the "Create five minor station misses. Identify drift, call the reset, participate, recognize completion, and release the team." practical rubric?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Acknowledges","Audit plan","Corrects promptly","Calls and executes a live reset"]'::jsonb, 'Calls and executes a live reset', 'This criterion appears in the keyed practical rubric: Calls and executes a live reset', 6, 'cur-leadership-week-2'),
