  ('q-v2-cur-leadership-week-7-08', 'quiz-v2-cur-leadership-week-7', 'Which statement is included under "Why it matters" in this module?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Reset - give one change for the next rep","Own one Teach > Demonstrate > Rehearse module","Using the phrase as punishment","Automatic escalation creates helplessness and leader bottlenecks. Resourcefulness separates the real constraint from the story around it."]'::jsonb, 'Automatic escalation creates helplessness and leader bottlenecks. Resourcefulness separates the real constraint from the story around it.', 'This statement appears verbatim under Why it matters.', 9, 'cur-leadership-week-7'),
