  ('q-v2-cur-leadership-week-8-02', 'quiz-v2-cur-leadership-week-8', 'Which outcome is explicitly listed for "Week 8 - Systems + Predictability"?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Use names, table numbers, and exact actions","Choose the correct method","Observe and coach each day''s behavior during live service.","Define the standard, owner, trigger, method, verification, and recovery for every critical system."]'::jsonb, 'Define the standard, owner, trigger, method, verification, and recovery for every critical system.', 'The module lists this as an explicit learning outcome: Define the standard, owner, trigger, method, verification, and recovery for every critical system.', 3, 'cur-leadership-week-8'),
