  ('q-final-v2-general-manager-cur-leadership-week-1-2', 'quiz-final-v2-general-manager', 'Which statement is included under "Why it matters" in this module?', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', '["Use professional language: no profanity, gossip, arguing, sexual or inappropriate conversation, panic, blame, or personal drama.","Teach: explain the purpose, observable standard, approved source, steps, decisions, and stop points.","Protect water, food, responsible service, and guest acknowledgment","The team studies what leaders model, ignore, reinforce, and repeat. A leader is always training."]'::jsonb, 'The team studies what leaders model, ignore, reinforce, and repeat. A leader is always training.', 'This statement appears verbatim under Why it matters.', 20, 'cur-leadership-week-1'),
